s by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Sunday REMOVED_MONTH 04   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03 16 41PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  Additional immunohistochemistry results A small epithelial proliferation near the inferior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   is consistent with a benign lobule with prominent myoepithelium and basement membrane  immunostains for calponin  smooth muscle myosin heavy chain  p63  and cytokeratin support the interpretation  Addendum  1 by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 08   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 02 35 42PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left   Excision PART B  Breast  Left posterior Margin   Excision PART C  Breast  Left inferior Margin   Excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
