one receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 15 48 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 2cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  ill defined  stellate  white  firm mass with focally yellow discoloration and a gritty cut surface  extending 0 1cm from the inked margin  A representative section is frozen as FX 1 and resubmitted in A  the remainder of the mass is submitted in B D  Resident  SAMANTHA J  PULLIAM  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST   INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
