within the remaining parenchyma including the lower outer quadrant  Also received detached from the main specimen are two tan yellow  lobulated additional portions of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  Both portions are inked black and serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable fibrofatty cut surfaces  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   entire well healed previous biopsy site with closest posterior margins in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and closest anterior in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   three representative sections of lower outer quadrant parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   four representative sections of lower outer quadrant parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   three representative sections of uninvolved mid to upper inner quadrant parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   representative sections of two detached additional portions of fibrofatty tissue  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and left breast is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 20 4 cm left simple mastectomy specimen with a short suture designating the superior and a long suture designating the lateral aspects  There is an REMOVED_DATE x 5 0 cm tan white skin ellipse on the anterior aspect with a centrally located unremarkable nipple measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  No scars are grossly appreciated  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a dense  rubbery  irregular to stellate area within the superior aspect  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The area is centrally hemorrhagic and comes to 0 9cm from the unremarkable superior anterior soft tissue margin  The remaining parenchyma consists of tan yellow  lobulated adipose tissue and dense fibrous tissue  The fibrous tissue is slightly nodular and contains multiple cysts averaging 0 3cm and filled with cloudy fluid  At the 6 oclock aspect there is a lobulated  protruding  rubbery tan pink nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The nodule comes to 0 5cm from the posterior margin  No additional discrete masses or lesions are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   representative sections  approximately 90  of the fibrotic area  to include anterior and posterior margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   three representative sections from the uninvolved parenchyma within the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  representative sections of uninvolved parenchyma from the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   entire protruding nodule to deep margin from the 6 oclock position  Gross Dictation by Jennifer Nash  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
