d 4 0cm from the nearest posterior margin is identified  The remainder of the breast tissue consists of tan white fibrous to yellow fatty tissue  No other masses are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The majority of the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest margin to the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Red nodule close to the cavity  bisected and entirely submitted   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest posterior and anterior margin to the red nodule   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The first described cyst   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The second described cyst along with closest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unremarkable breast tissue from the medial portion of the specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unremarkable breast tissue in the lateral portion of the specimen  Gross Dictation by Vincent Ko M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Vincent Ko M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
