minations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  27 AUG 98 at 09 20     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR HER 2 c erb REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Breast  Right   The tumor cells show strong overexpression of HER 2 c erb 2  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  02 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 16 29 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  is a breast biopsy measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm with a needle localization wire in place  A firm 2 1cm mass is filled within the specimen  The specimen is inked black and sectioned to reveal a white infiltrative mass within  1 0mm from inked margin  Representative sections are in A C  Resident  ADRIANO PIRIS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
